1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:07,670
When I was six or seven, Meskel was one
of the most special times of the year.

2
00:00:09,170 --> 00:00:14,870
My mother's family would gather at my
grandfather's house, bringing their children.

3
00:00:16,370 --> 00:00:21,540
The young adults prepared kitfo and
other traditional dishes.

4
00:00:23,040 --> 00:00:27,200
We children played and waited.

5
00:00:29,540 --> 00:00:37,780
At last we all gathered in the living room to
eat. Grass was spread across the wooden floor.

6
00:00:39,280 --> 00:00:44,120
Pictures of my grandparents hung on the
walls.

7
00:00:45,620 --> 00:00:52,750
We children sat at the table; the adults
on the sofas and duka stools.

8
00:00:56,120 --> 00:01:03,890
Incense and coffee filled the room with
warmth, laughter and family.

9
00:01:10,620 --> 00:01:14,830
That house, that Meskel, that laughter…
are still with me today.
